Here is the generated code to evaluate:

<!-- @FIGURE_UI_BEGIN -->
<div style="font-weight:bold;font-size:13px">Toroid — flux through the cut face</div>
<label>radius&nbsp;<i>r</i> = <span id="rOut">2.70</span> m
  <input id="radiusR" type="range" min="2" max="3.2" step="0.02" value="2.7">
</label>
